 edu</a>&#160\;</p>
X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>The BioSpeculations Symposium brings together arti
 sts\, biohackers\, filmmakers\, cultural theorists\, curators\, and stude
 nts to think through the history\, possibilities\, and future of biohacki
 ng vis-a-vis bioart.</p>
END:VEVENT
